name finstrut
category Package
revision 21719
shortdesc Adjust behaviour of the ends of footnotes
relocated 1
longdesc The LaTeX internal command \@finalstrut is used automatically
longdesc used at the end of footnote texts to insert a strut to avoid
longdesc mis-spacing of multiple footnotes. Unfortunately the command
longdesc can cause a blank line at the end of a footnote. The package
longdesc provides a solution to this problem.
runfiles size=2
